# 原安装包缺少 by.cab；此补充脚本绘制普通话四声的五度制示意曲线。
# 这些是声调示意值，不是实测值，也不是原版 T 值统计数据。
Erase all
Select outer viewport: 0, 6, 0, 4
Axes: 0, 1, 1, 5
Draw inner box
Marks left every: 1, 1, "yes", "yes", "no"
Marks bottom every: 1, 0.2, "yes", "yes", "no"
Text left: "yes", "声调五度制（示意）"
Text bottom: "yes", "相对时长"
Black
Draw line: 0, 5, 1, 5
Red
Draw line: 0, 3, 1, 5
Blue
Draw line: 0, 2, 0.5, 1
Draw line: 0.5, 1, 1, 4
Green
Draw line: 0, 5, 1, 1
Black
